# Source keeps LF on every platform. Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites text files to CRLF, and `cargo fmt --check`
# fails ("Incorrect newline style") on the very first CI run — measured on
# windows-latest. eol=lf forces LF at checkout; text=auto lets Git decide
# what counts as text.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalize, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
